": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It's the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc failed in staging.\n- **Result:** After the rollback, checkout-api reports v2.3.0 in every region, healthy, with an error rate of 0.002. Before the rollback it was 0.18.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the post-rollback state. It also notes that v2.3.1 needs investigation before any redeploy.", "type": "text"}]}]}